Subject: [PATCH V2 4/4] i2c: s3c2410: Remove err_cpufreq label
Date: Fri, 23 Nov 2012 14:11:55 +0530
Message-Id: <1353660115-9710-5-git-send-email-tushar.behera@linaro.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.4.1
